 "The prompt is \"a carved wooden giraffe\". There is little 3D training data, so most systems start from an image model.": "bfdd382758.mp3",
 "A multi view model draws the carving from four camera angles at once, with attention across the views so they agree.": "ee0fc05367.mp3",
